  "start": "lab",
  "intro": "The night shift was supposed to be quiet. Then the alarm went off, the doors sealed and the lights dropped to emergency red. In the corner, the big tank is still glowing, and whatever floats inside it is awake. Shut the experiment down and the lockdown should lift.",
  "winTitle": "Lockdown lifted",
  "winText": "The tank goes dark, the subject curls up to sleep and the steel door hisses open. Whatever Dr. Hale was working on, it can wait until morning.",
